# ─── Raw + derived signal data (≈2.5 GB, re-downloadable — never commit) ──────
# NOTE: patterns must cover subdirs too (data/deep/, data/beast_tmp/, ...).
# `*` does not cross `/`, so bare `data/*.f32` missed data/deep (2026-09-20).
data/**/*.raw
data/**/*.f32
data/**/*.bin
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.npy
data/*.raw
data/*.f32
data/*.bin
data/*.png
data/mvp_tmp/
data/longhaul_tmp/
data/beast_tmp/
data/deep/

# ─── Houdini generated output (terrains, EXRs, macro strips) ──────────────────
houdini/out/

# ─── Compiled C tools — rebuild with gcc, see README ─────────────────────────
c/*.exe
c/proofs/*.exe
c/seti_slice
c/fam_scan
c/vm_sandbox
c/*.o

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ─── Runtime artifacts (regenerated per run) ─────────────────────────────────
alpha_candidates.txt

# ─── Houdini sessions — the network is code (houdini/hython_triage.py) ───────
*.hip
*.hipnc
*.hiplc
*.hiplc

# ─── Editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.json
*.csv
*.f32
*.exe
*.npy
*.npz
*.wav
*.fil
*.h5
*.exe

# ─── Campaign scratch on the big drive (D:), never the repo drive ───────────
# Campaign bulk outputs live under runs/campaigns/ (junction to D:/data/runs).
# Ignore the junction contents in git; catalog.tsv is the committed record.
runs/campaigns/

# ─── Corpus database (derived, regenerable — rebuild, never commit) ──────────
# python/corpus.py --auto rebuilds it from the committed record above.
corpus/*.db

# ─── Kain build outputs (E:/setiyeti/kain/) ─────────────────────────────────
# .kn sources are committed. Everything the compiler generates is not:
# .kain/ = per-project out/, cache/, reports/ (like data/, regenerable).
kain/.kain/
kain/out/
.kain/
*.bin
*.js
*.log
